title: "Replication materials for: When Multi-Venue Benchmarks Become Effectively Concentrated"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Jin"
    given-names: "Junjie"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jjjfee/btc-reference-price-fragmentation"
abstract: >
  Replication materials accompanying the paper "When Multi-Venue Benchmarks
  Become Effectively Concentrated: Evidence from Fragmented BTCUSD Markets".
  The repository contains code, selected paper outputs, run information,
  diagnostics, source-data manifests, and reproduction notes for a benchmark-
  mapping analysis of VWAP and LWMP in fragmented BTCUSD markets.
keywords:
